    "detailed_description": "Aim in Space is a space simulator for training eSports skills. Here you will be able to develop the speed of your reaction, the ability to aim accurately, and also to think quickly.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse yourself in the exciting atmosphere of the game</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642230/extras/ea3a587f0a2744106b7b4cc74c0957b7.avif?t=1706714159\" width=600 height=162 /></span><br><br>Here you will travel through space locations that must be protected from alien attacks. At each subsequent space base, there will be more and more new enemies. Don't give up and stay in line! Try to complete all 24 levels to repel all enemy attacks and save the earthlings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Train your thinking speed</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642230/extras/8d3af6edee23ea7c0749ec545e443131.avif?t=1706714159\" width=600 height=218 /></span><br><br>Unlike similar games, here you need to not only click on the target with the same mouse button. Everything is much more interesting! Different forms of attack must be used to destroy the various spaceships of the aliens. Galactic Intelligence will send you information from the secret archives on what combination of strikes will take down each of the possible enemies. Remember these combinations and use them correctly for each type of alien!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features of the game</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642230/extras/a0073af3321d81dbbee4d137b4c589e8.avif?t=1706714159\" width=600 height=258 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 planets<br></li><li> 24 levels<br></li><li> various enemies<br></li><li> a challenge to your reaction and aiming</li></ul><br>We are waiting for you, commander! Help us save all military bases!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642230/extras/376d87551f44dc9e554fa4d259bd6cdf.avif?t=1706714159\" width=600 height=132 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Aim in Space is a space simulator for training eSports skills. Here you will be able to develop the speed of your reaction, the ability to aim accurately, and also to think quickly.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse yourself in the exciting atmosphere of the game</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642230/extras/ea3a587f0a2744106b7b4cc74c0957b7.avif?t=1706714159\" width=600 height=162 /></span><br><br>Here you will travel through space locations that must be protected from alien attacks. At each subsequent space base, there will be more and more new enemies. Don't give up and stay in line! Try to complete all 24 levels to repel all enemy attacks and save the earthlings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Train your thinking speed</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642230/extras/8d3af6edee23ea7c0749ec545e443131.avif?t=1706714159\" width=600 height=218 /></span><br><br>Unlike similar games, here you need to not only click on the target with the same mouse button. Everything is much more interesting! Different forms of attack must be used to destroy the various spaceships of the aliens. Galactic Intelligence will send you information from the secret archives on what combination of strikes will take down each of the possible enemies. Remember these combinations and use them correctly for each type of alien!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features of the game</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642230/extras/a0073af3321d81dbbee4d137b4c589e8.avif?t=1706714159\" width=600 height=258 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 planets<br></li><li> 24 levels<br></li><li> various enemies<br></li><li> a challenge to your reaction and aiming</li></ul><br>We are waiting for you, commander! Help us save all military bases!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642230/extras/376d87551f44dc9e554fa4d259bd6cdf.avif?t=1706714159\" width=600 height=132 /></span>",
